        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Starting a baby registry doesn’t have to feel overwhelming, even if you’re a first-time mom. But narrowing down baby products and tracking various registry perks can easily become mind-blowing. Our baby registry checklist, best of baby registries guide, and product recommendations help you create your perfect baby registry.",
